106
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,680
He's great at both academics

107
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:33,880
and sports.

108
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:35,880
He's simply perfect.

109
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,120
Dig in already,

110
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,360
or it'll get cold.

111
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,200
Right,

112
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,280
Podduang.

113
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:45,640
Do you know that

114
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,600
all the pretty girls at university

115
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,200
