116
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,120
I'm so jealous.

117
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,160
He's my idol.

118
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,400
My friends in the same year

119
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,400
