164
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,200
I only want you to pretend.

165
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,480
You're...

166
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,400
You're just that slow, aren't you?

167
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,840
How many times do I have to

168
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,680
