178
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,440
That's it what?

179
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,160
That's what I call pretending to hit on me.

180
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,600
Poddauang,

181
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,480
I told you I don't like pretending.

182
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,200
Right, right.

183
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,120
Fine.

184
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,400
I'll let you go to sleep, then.

185
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,840
Sweet dreams.

186
