She lashes out at everyone around her.

859
00:39:31,040 --> 00:39:33,280
I truly have to thank you...

860
00:39:34,080 --> 00:39:35,320
for staying by Anda's side

861
00:39:35,880 --> 00:39:37,560
while he was still alive,

862
00:39:39,160 --> 00:39:40,840
until the very day he...

863
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:43,840
It was nothing.

864
00:39:44,560 --> 00:39:46,000
Anda was my best friend.

865
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:47,960
Though...

866
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,840
I never wanted to plan my friend's funeral.

867
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:52,160
But I'm more than willing to.

868
00:39:52,680 --> 00:39:54,560
If there's anything else about
Anda that I can help with,

869
00:39:54,560 --> 00:39:55,560
please let me know.

870
00:39:55,680 --> 00:39:56,560
I'll help.

871
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:03,560
My brother was truly blessed

872
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:05,760
to have you as his friend.

873
00:40:06,160 --> 00:40:07,360
Thank you very much.

874
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,000
What now, Anda?

875
00:40:24,160 --> 00:40:24,840
"Jinna..."

876
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:38,000
My shrimp.

877
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:39,720
My shrimp...

878
00:40:40,120 --> 00:40:41,800
It's mine. I claimed it first.

879
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,840
It's mine.

880
00:40:44,120 --> 00:40:45,280
I claimed it first.

881
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:46,560
Typical.

882
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:47,720
Always fighting each other.

883
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:49,240
Now, now, Jinna.

884
00:40:49,640 --> 00:40:50,840
Don't throw shade at us,

885
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:53,560
or Podduang might think we're weirdos.

886
00:40:58,360 --> 00:40:59,800
Hey, hey, hey.

887
00:41:01,560 --> 00:41:02,120
Stay still.

888
00:41:02,120 --> 00:41:03,320
It'll mess up my shirt.

889
00:41:05,240 --> 00:41:07,120
You're always bitching
about stuff, aren't you,

890
00:41:07,120 --> 00:41:07,760
huh?

891
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:09,960
You're not bitching, right?

892
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:10,800
What?

893
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:12,360
Hey, hey, hey!

894
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:13,560
