895
00:41:13,560 --> 00:41:15,000
This shirt is a one-off.

896
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:16,320
Ridiculous, Art.

897
00:41:16,320 --> 00:41:17,320
It's true.

898
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:18,240
See?

899
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:20,560
I got it from an online thrift store.

900
00:41:20,760 --> 00:41:22,040
You can't get it

901
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:23,560
in this size and print anymore.

902
00:41:25,560 --> 00:41:26,960
It's like destiny.

903
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:28,800
Aren't you worried...

904
00:41:28,800 --> 00:41:30,440
they sold you dead people's clothes?

905
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,200
Maybe...

906
00:41:31,560 --> 00:41:32,880
