909
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:37,880
Come on,

910
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,600
that sounds like something
out of a horror show.

911
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:42,840
Everyone wears secondhand clothes.

912
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,400
How about this?

913
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:47,880
The shrimp you're eating

914
00:41:48,560 --> 00:41:50,360
