915
00:41:51,040 --> 00:41:52,040
The spirit of that shrimp...

916
00:41:52,560 --> 00:41:53,560
Are you scared of it?

917
00:41:54,560 --> 00:41:55,240
Hey.

918
00:41:56,080 --> 00:41:57,120
Be careful.

919
00:41:58,160 --> 00:41:59,360
The shrimp spirit...

920
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:01,120
The shrimp...

921
00:42:02,040 --> 00:42:02,880
It'll come and get you.

922
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:03,800
You find that funny?

923
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:04,560
Obviously.

924
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:05,800
Tod and Art are funny.

925
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,560
Come and have a meal with us more often.

926
00:42:08,560 --> 00:42:10,560
Come on, we don't have to
fight over some shrimp.

927
00:42:10,560 --> 00:42:12,000
We can order some more.

928
00:42:57,920 --> 00:42:59,000
Jinna...

929
00:43:00,480 --> 00:43:01,640
What is it?

930
00:43:05,640 --> 00:43:07,000
Are you crying?

931
00:43:55,840 --> 00:43:57,360
I'm actually fine.

932
00:43:57,800 --> 00:43:59,080
I was riding the motorbike...

933
00:43:59,440 --> 00:44:00,520
and the wind was hitting my face.

934
00:44:00,920 --> 00:44:02,080
That's why I teared up.

935
00:44:04,520 --> 00:44:05,640
Really...

936
00:44:11,520 --> 00:44:13,480
Want me to wash your face in my room?

937
00:44:14,720 --> 00:44:16,280
I'm actually not crying, you know?

938
00:44:17,760 --> 00:44:18,680
Right.

939
00:44:18,680 --> 00:44:20,280
You're not crying.

940
00:44:21,080 --> 00:44:23,400
Just come with me and wash your face.

941
00:44:25,520 --> 00:44:25,920
Come on.

942
00:44:25,920 --> 00:44:26,840
I'll take it off for you.

943
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:38,480
Come on.

944
00:45:14,360 --> 00:45:15,800
Satang isn't here?

945
00:45:17,720 --> 00:45:18,640
He's away.

946
00:45:18,880 --> 00:45:19,600
He'll be back late.

947
00:45:19,600 --> 00:45:20,680
He's been with his friends lately.

948
00:45:30,920 --> 00:45:32,080
What are you looking at?

949
00:45:33,080 --> 00:45:34,640
The one who wasn't crying...

950
00:45:35,920 --> 00:45:37,240
You love teasing people, huh?

951
00:45:45,680 --> 00:45:47,080
My friend's dead.

952
00:45:47,640 --> 00:45:49,080
Let me cry for a bit, okay?

953
00:45:51,080 --> 00:45:53,080
I miss him whenever I'm on the road.

954
00:45:57,320 --> 00:45:58,320
Jinna.

955
00:45:59,880 --> 00:46:01,320
Maybe you don't know it yet,

956
00:46:02,080 --> 00:46:05,080
but I really love Anda as an actor.

957
00:46:07,800 --> 00:46:10,040
He's my source of joy.

958
00:46:11,400 --> 00:46:13,240
It broke my heart when
someone insulted him.

959
00:46:13,840 --> 00:46:15,400
I was happy when
someone complimented him.

960
00:46:16,440 --> 00:46:18,400
And when this happened to him,

961
00:46:21,080 --> 00:46:22,680
I could barely hold myself together.

962
00:46:24,960 --> 00:46:26,560
I just want to tell you that

963
00:46:28,200 --> 00:46:29,520
if you're hurting,

964
00:46:29,520 --> 00:46:31,200
