965
00:46:31,960 --> 00:46:34,280
Don't worry about how people will see you.

966
00:46:36,840 --> 00:46:38,960
He was your best friend, Jinna.

967
00:46:40,120 --> 00:46:41,480
Everyone understands you.

968
00:46:48,240 --> 00:46:49,600
Can I hug you?

969
00:47:20,320 --> 00:47:25,400
♫It started with fate guiding us to hold hands♫

970
00:47:25,400 --> 00:47:30,520
♫Or when I learned your number
like the back of my hand♫

971
00:47:30,520 --> 00:47:34,880
